WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.880
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:25.150 --> 00:29.370
[Live Forever]

3
00:30.440 --> 00:32.950
[Episode 14]

4
00:54.200 --> 00:55.350
Eat it.

5
00:56.200 --> 00:57.350
Maybe you can get a chance

6
00:57.350 --> 00:59.150
to be together forever.

7
01:10.680 --> 01:11.310
Do you

8
01:12.710 --> 01:13.710
recognize me?

9
01:16.280 --> 01:17.310
No.

10
01:23.070 --> 01:23.920
You look very much like

11
01:23.920 --> 01:25.840
an old friend who was kind to me.

12
01:34.000 --> 01:36.509
There's something ancient about your scent,

13
01:36.509 --> 01:38.590
like wood that's been buried underground

14
01:38.590 --> 01:39.920
for thousands of years.

15
01:40.110 --> 01:42.560
No one else smells like that.

16
01:44.720 --> 01:47.430
[Memorial Tablet of Chen Gensheng]

17
01:49.229 --> 01:50.229
Granny Chen,

18
01:51.320 --> 01:52.680
is she your mother?

19
01:56.110 --> 01:57.390
Mother?

20
01:58.259 --> 02:01.260
She watered and took care of me.

21
02:03.120 --> 02:05.120
Does that make her a mother?

22
02:12.190 --> 02:13.790
Your family has passed away.

23
02:14.710 --> 02:16.630
I can't bring them back to life.

24
02:18.310 --> 02:19.190
But I promise,

25
02:20.590 --> 02:21.800
from now on,

26
02:22.560 --> 02:23.890
you'll want for nothing

27
02:24.470 --> 02:25.870
and live a peaceful life.

28
02:26.120 --> 02:27.120
I, Ning Changyue,

29
02:29.190 --> 02:30.360
always keep my word.

30
02:30.640 --> 02:32.760
Granny and my brother also said

31
02:32.780 --> 02:34.510
they would always stay with me.

32
02:34.910 --> 02:37.190
But they still disappeared.

33
02:38.240 --> 02:39.590
The neighbors said

34
02:40.360 --> 02:42.030
I should cry

35
02:42.630 --> 02:44.490
when the people who love me leave.

36
02:45.079 --> 02:46.840
But I don't really know how.

37
02:47.410 --> 02:49.020
I just feel

38
02:52.280 --> 02:54.079
empty inside.

39
02:55.310 --> 02:56.910
But it also feels like something

40
02:56.910 --> 02:58.470
has filled it up.

41
03:00.470 --> 03:02.280
Have you ever felt this way?

42
03:11.000 --> 03:12.430
If you were here,

43
03:13.190 --> 03:15.310
you would definitely be able to tell her

44
03:15.310 --> 03:16.680
what this feeling is.

45
03:22.800 --> 03:23.560
Qiu,

46
03:23.920 --> 03:25.470
I will bring you back.

47
03:26.360 --> 03:36.400
Marry him.

48
04:09.360 --> 04:10.240
Song Yiqiu.

49
04:12.110 --> 04:14.520
You really should start a whole new life,

50
04:15.840 --> 04:19.519
instead of staying with a thousand-year-old piece of wood like me,

51
04:19.519 --> 04:20.709
and rotting away

52
04:21.820 --> 04:22.770
together.

53
04:28.080 --> 04:32.780
[Live Forever]

54
05:32.870 --> 05:33.720
See?

55
05:40.159 --> 05:42.890
The gilt phoenix hairpin from the Southern Tang.

56
05:42.920 --> 05:45.650
The ice-crackle jade vase from the Yuan Dynasty.

57
05:47.510 --> 05:48.870
Wu School's Landscape of the Southern Mountains

58
05:48.870 --> 05:50.130
from the Ming Dynasty.

59
05:50.800 --> 05:52.190
And the gold-and-silver inlaid pieces

60
05:52.190 --> 05:53.950
you brought back from Persia.

61
05:54.720 --> 05:55.850
These are the things

62
05:56.190 --> 05:57.600
you left behind or lost over

63
05:57.600 --> 05:59.510
the past three thousand years.

64
06:00.920 --> 06:02.380
I found everything I could

65
06:03.240 --> 06:04.570
and brought it all here.

66
06:07.360 --> 06:08.820
There are also some things

67
06:09.070 --> 06:10.470
I thought you might like.

68
06:11.160 --> 06:13.720
The phoenix crown and ceremonial robes of the former dynasty's empress.

69
06:13.720 --> 06:15.250
They were far too elaborate

70
06:15.310 --> 06:16.370
for everyday wear,

71
06:17.190 --> 06:18.520
so I had them taken apart

72
06:18.630 --> 06:20.190
and used the pearls and kingfisher feathers

73
06:20.190 --> 06:22.190
to make you a lighter set of jewelry.

74
06:22.600 --> 06:24.920
The embroiderers here can't compare to those in Southern Qin,

75
06:24.920 --> 06:26.190
so I had them work overnight

76
06:26.190 --> 06:30.520
to make a full set of "Hundred Sons, Thousand Grandsons" quilts and curtains.

77
06:31.940 --> 06:34.630
Although not as exquisite as those in the palace,

78
06:34.630 --> 06:35.890
they're for good luck.

79
06:37.040 --> 06:37.640
Oh, right.

80
06:38.110 --> 06:39.710
I bought a villa with a garden

81
06:39.860 --> 06:42.159
in the best part of the foreign concession.

82
06:42.159 --> 06:43.690
The house deed and land deed

83
06:44.120 --> 06:46.050
are both in the name of Song Baiwei.

84
06:48.950 --> 06:49.950
In the garden,

85
06:50.720 --> 06:52.920
I had a whole bed of white roses planted.

86
06:54.950 --> 06:56.240
They'll be in bloom

87
06:58.490 --> 06:59.530
by summer.

88
07:13.190 --> 07:15.190
Are you switching careers

89
07:15.190 --> 07:17.360
to become an antique dealer

90
07:17.600 --> 07:19.270
or a jewelry merchant?

91
07:19.560 --> 07:21.000
Look at all this.

92
07:21.450 --> 07:25.850
Anyone who didn't know better would think you were preparing a betrothal gift.

93
07:30.960 --> 07:32.420
It's not a betrothal gift.

94
07:36.000 --> 07:36.870
It's a dowry.

95
07:52.250 --> 07:53.870
It's been thousands of years.

96
07:53.870 --> 07:56.600
I haven't seen you smile like this for a long time.

97
07:58.830 --> 08:00.290
The life of a mortal couple

98
08:01.000 --> 08:02.510
is only a few decades.

99
08:05.020 --> 08:07.820
If you insist on tasting this fleeting sweetness,

100
08:08.250 --> 08:10.710
then I will give you the grandest fireworks.

101
08:14.040 --> 08:15.640
I'll make this dream of yours

102
08:16.700 --> 08:17.970
lavish, dazzling,

103
08:18.920 --> 08:20.250
and bright enough that,

104
08:21.550 --> 08:22.950
in the long years to come,

105
08:25.040 --> 08:26.870
you can look back on this moment

106
08:28.260 --> 08:30.310
and remember how happy you were.

107
08:35.760 --> 08:36.950
But Song Baiwei,

108
08:39.600 --> 08:42.260
if he makes you suffer even the slightest wrong,

109
08:43.260 --> 08:45.320
I'll make him regret ever being born.

110
08:49.480 --> 08:52.120
If he can keep you smiling like this,

111
08:55.520 --> 08:57.520
then smile to your heart's content.

112
09:03.760 --> 09:06.360
Let it make up for all these thousands of years.

113
09:19.480 --> 09:20.510
Ning Changyue,

114
09:28.270 --> 09:29.390
are you serious?

115
09:40.120 --> 09:41.920
It's been three thousand years.

116
09:43.140 --> 09:44.260
What I can give you,

117
09:46.440 --> 09:48.720
besides this half-dead life,

118
09:49.840 --> 09:51.840
is only these worldly possessions.

119
09:54.310 --> 09:55.350
Just consider it

120
09:58.490 --> 10:01.350
a dowry from an older brother to his younger sister.

121
10:21.980 --> 10:24.010
♪ Watching time flow ♪

122
10:24.040 --> 10:25.560
♪ Hearing the years sigh softly ♪

123
10:25.580 --> 10:28.350
♪ Immortality still cannot bring fulfillment ♪

124
10:28.370 --> 10:30.570
♪ Even if fate has destined us to part ♪

125
10:30.600 --> 10:32.450
♪ I'll still fight with all I have ♪

126
10:32.480 --> 10:35.850
♪ And cling to you with all my might ♪

127
10:36.130 --> 10:37.890
♪ I'd give up immortality ♪

128
10:37.920 --> 10:39.720
♪ To share this joy and sorrow with you ♪

129
10:40.110 --> 10:42.510
♪ Don't ask how absurd the ending may be ♪

130
10:42.790 --> 10:48.570
♪ I'd trade this life for eternity ♪

131
10:48.600 --> 10:52.260
♪ Then we'd be complete ♪

132
11:11.120 --> 11:12.440
So these things

133
11:12.840 --> 11:15.500
have been hidden in your heart for so many years.

134
11:19.440 --> 11:21.550
Now I've made you sad again.

135
11:23.360 --> 11:24.150
Qiu.

136
11:24.870 --> 11:26.730
Even if our red thread is severed,

137
11:27.020 --> 11:28.660
I'll tie it back together.

138
11:31.790 --> 11:32.600
Mr. Lin.

139
11:33.080 --> 11:34.960
You've been looking for me constantly lately,

140
11:34.960 --> 11:36.440
left me so many messages,

141
11:36.750 --> 11:38.630
and even came all the way here to tell me

142
11:38.630 --> 11:41.160
the story behind this marriage certificate.

143
11:41.750 --> 11:43.510
You should keep it.

144
11:43.870 --> 11:44.630
Consider it

145
11:44.660 --> 11:46.120
fulfilling your destiny.

146
12:01.840 --> 12:02.600
Thank you.

147
12:02.790 --> 12:03.990
If it weren't for you,

148
12:04.720 --> 12:07.450
I might never have had the chance to find it again.

149
12:11.280 --> 12:14.480
If you refuse to change, face the problem, or deal with it,

150
12:14.600 --> 12:17.000
of course you'll repeat the same mistakes.

151
12:23.820 --> 12:24.750
Xie He.

152
12:43.680 --> 12:45.140
Thank you for taking me in.

153
12:45.170 --> 12:47.100
I'm going to solve my problems now.

154
12:56.480 --> 12:57.360
Thank you.

155
12:58.280 --> 12:59.880
I'm going to find my destiny.

156
13:00.960 --> 13:01.670
Good luck!

157
13:09.630 --> 13:10.240
Qiu.

158
13:11.030 --> 13:11.960
Be home

159
13:12.440 --> 13:13.440
at seven tonight.

160
13:13.680 --> 13:15.880
I have something important to tell you.

161
14:07.710 --> 14:08.370
Song Yiqiu!

162
14:08.720 --> 14:09.380
Song Yiqiu!

163
14:12.910 --> 14:13.750
Song Yiqiu.

164
14:16.780 --> 14:17.480
Song Yiqiu.

165
14:18.390 --> 14:19.790
Song Yiqiu, look at me.

166
14:19.910 --> 14:20.600
Song Yiqiu.

167
14:22.870 --> 14:23.930
Don't fall asleep.

168
14:24.550 --> 14:25.550
Don't fall asleep. Wake up.

169
14:25.550 --> 14:26.390
Look at me.

170
14:26.600 --> 14:27.260
Song Yiqiu.

171
14:28.960 --> 14:29.620
Song Yiqiu.

172
14:34.480 --> 14:35.120
Don't...

173
14:35.390 --> 14:36.630
Don't call.

174
14:37.150 --> 14:38.120
Don't call.

175
14:39.030 --> 14:40.550
I won't die.

176
14:40.570 --> 14:41.570
Find...

177
14:41.600 --> 14:43.240
Find Ning Changyue.

178
14:43.260 --> 14:44.380
Find Ning...

179
14:45.010 --> 14:45.840
Find...

180
14:52.080 --> 14:52.740
Song Yiqiu.

181
14:53.870 --> 14:54.550
Song Yiqiu!

182
14:55.150 --> 14:56.320
Song Yiqiu!

183
14:57.840 --> 14:58.870
Song Yiqiu.

184
15:00.910 --> 15:02.150
Wake up.

185
15:04.100 --> 15:04.670
Song Yiqiu!

186
15:04.670 --> 15:06.120
Wake up!

187
15:08.280 --> 15:09.430
Wake up.

188
15:11.050 --> 15:13.210
♪ So here is to you ♪

189
15:15.760 --> 15:18.760
♪ My darling ♪

190
15:19.690 --> 15:22.160
♪ And here is to you ♪

191
15:23.820 --> 15:26.910
♪ My friend ♪

192
15:27.690 --> 15:30.690
♪ Here is to you ♪

193
15:31.470 --> 15:34.430
♪ My lover ♪

194
15:36.620 --> 15:42.430
♪ I'll follow you until the end ♪

195
15:44.380 --> 15:45.020
Hello.

196
15:45.580 --> 15:47.580
Someone is seriously injured here.

197
15:48.240 --> 15:49.520
I'm at... I'm at...

198
15:52.310 --> 15:53.370
What are you doing?

199
15:53.530 --> 15:55.560
She's injured. She needs to go to the hospital.

200
15:54.800 --> 16:01.800
♪ So when the fire are burning ♪

201
15:56.030 --> 15:57.120
If you don't want her wounds

202
15:57.120 --> 15:58.720
to heal in front of everyone,

203
15:59.000 --> 15:59.840
dead one second

204
15:59.840 --> 16:01.200
and bouncing back the next,

205
16:01.200 --> 16:02.790
only to be taken away for experiments,

206
16:02.790 --> 16:03.960
put the phone down.

207
16:03.490 --> 16:10.760
♪ And when the light fades away ♪

208
16:11.450 --> 16:17.910
♪ When the sky is falling ♪

209
16:13.550 --> 16:14.200
Qiu.

210
16:20.120 --> 16:25.980
♪ I'll never let you be alone ♪

211
16:26.030 --> 16:27.440
Someone tried to kill me.

212
16:29.870 --> 16:31.670
She took the knife for me.

213
16:34.670 --> 16:35.600
She got hurt

214
16:37.510 --> 16:39.000
because of me.

215
16:40.600 --> 16:41.860
If it weren't for me...

216
16:43.040 --> 16:44.170
If it weren't for me,

217
16:45.840 --> 16:46.770
she wouldn't...

218
17:03.200 --> 17:04.720
That was her own choice,

219
17:03.260 --> 17:07.030
♪ So here is to you ♪

220
17:07.270 --> 17:09.440
just like when she saved you in your past life.

221
17:07.740 --> 17:11.240
♪ My darling ♪

222
17:11.260 --> 17:14.880
♪ And here is to you ♪

223
17:15.380 --> 17:18.099
♪ My friend ♪

224
17:19.660 --> 17:23.500
♪ Here is to you ♪

225
17:20.880 --> 17:21.829
What's going on?

226
17:22.550 --> 17:24.000
Why isn't the wound healing?

227
17:24.000 --> 17:27.060
♪ My lover ♪

228
17:26.550 --> 17:28.000
Go to the hospital now.

229
17:27.770 --> 17:37.310
♪ I'll follow you until the end ♪

230
17:41.330 --> 17:56.140
♪ I'll follow you until the end ♪

231
18:02.940 --> 18:03.730
Doctor.

232
18:04.830 --> 18:06.340
The patient is in critical condition.

233
18:06.340 --> 18:09.000
If the knife had been a fraction off, she couldn't have been saved.

234
18:09.000 --> 18:10.590
She's still in critical condition.

235
18:10.590 --> 18:12.310
Please wait outside.

236
18:23.480 --> 18:25.070
Find that person.

237
19:02.420 --> 19:03.180
Qiu.

238
19:04.580 --> 19:06.310
Your recovery has slowed down.

239
19:06.840 --> 19:09.570
Is it because the power of immortality is fading?

240
19:10.530 --> 19:13.190
Ending immortality with you was just an excuse.

241
19:13.480 --> 19:14.420
I just wanted to get

242
19:14.420 --> 19:16.150
the chance to stay by your side.

243
19:17.560 --> 19:18.710
I got what I wanted.

244
19:19.200 --> 19:20.030
But...

245
19:21.590 --> 19:23.310
but I caused you to lie here.

246
19:26.410 --> 19:27.800
Was I wrong again?

247
19:39.590 --> 19:42.250
I think I've seen this person somewhere before.

248
19:42.550 --> 19:43.920
Where was it?

249
19:47.880 --> 19:48.400
Wu Ya.

250
19:48.830 --> 19:49.930
Take good care of her.

251
19:49.930 --> 19:51.130
Don't leave her side.

252
20:18.080 --> 20:19.110
Xie He.
